#: e8553b31b5404957974ba1064b4f06dd
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports :ref:`DroneCAN<common-uavcan-setup-advanced>` servos. "
"DroneCAN connected servos offer high noise immunity and longer lead runs "
"that normal :ref:`PWM servos<common-servo>`."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot支持 :ref:`DroneCAN<common-uavcan-setup-advanced>` "
"舵机。DroneCAN连接的舵机相比普通 :ref:`PWM舵机<common-servo>` 具有更高的抗噪性和更长的引线距离。"

