#: e457c871ff3544ddb36e009acfe47f47
msgid "Autopilot Setup"
msgstr "飞控设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:17
#: 0fd9604d243e4312af26de8a6972d4eb 4e0de216f736405a80c65e9395dd04e1
#: 80b1101505154e239b59f144fb33792c cd70f65547c3422fb1415360550043b5
#: ef9f0511e4964afb8238b4530d185981
msgid ""
"There are several parameters that determine which autopilot servo/motor "
"channels are sent to the DroneCAN servos: For the examples below, the values"
" are shown for DroneCAN driver #1 using CAN Port #1"
msgstr "有几个参数决定哪些飞控舵机/电机通道通过DroneCAN发送给舵机：以下示例以使用CAN端口1的DroneCAN驱动1为例"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:20
#: 25ee9e2b2be34cf3815ff4cbc57194d6 5c2560bf3fb94cde95c6b17c461912ad
#: 71504f111c0c4f30a8f07f7d1eb4ba20 7266c0820ba14d1099ff456ec6dbc2f9
#: fa74ff20e5cf45b7b3530e6b21e3381c
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1, which assigns driver1 to port1"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1，将驱动 1 分配到端口 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:21
#: 325a70bcc67e45e0bb46eb4f8a067a92 3ca9d382887d46c6876d5411a1e91100
#: d92c270cbed541029935dca3ad523c9a daf2de0d11594ad5b5b21b70623850b5
#: fdf88f642362410591e1d09e07ae442e
msgid ":ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (DroneCAN protocol)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 1（DroneCAN 协议）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:22
#: 2058d744d70c442c80fe5177ec33d267 25df85ada5f84e6fb0b9ac67f764712a
#: 37442903c2234daabca9c00e410a9cdd 3df523f6915949bf870e15127c8f4df1
#: a06396b11a024be4bab088957bf0e358
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_NODE<CAN_D1_UC_NODE>`: node ID of the autopilot sending the "
"commands to the servos so that there can be differentiation between multiple"
" sources on the CAN bus. This is normally automatically set during "
"discovery, but can be altered for advanced configurations (multiple sources "
"on the bus)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_NODE<CAN_D1_UC_NODE>`：飞控发送命令到舵机的节点ID，以便区分CAN总线上的多个来源。通常在发现过程中自动设置，但可在高级配置（总线上多个来源）中更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:23
#: 03a806fa8f96443fbcbb65bab773d718 63600c433a6c437f80041d6db55de11a
#: 8e56c736aca346369825b308b3664b0d b0210f9225864420bfc289808f8ea6f4
#: bf1bff413e70475494d9f39d2b5d8cde
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_SRV_BM<CAN_D1_UC_SRV_BM>`: bitmask of servo output channels "
"that should be sent via DroneCAN"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_SRV_BM<CAN_D1_UC_SRV_BM>`：应通过DroneCAN发送的舵机输出通道位掩码"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:24
#: 3b250cf9ca7b4287a66412dbc1bf479c 40919e66878d4d8999e31aebc23a69c7
#: 6740b5b4a94c40f09c339d67517d9801 ab4f83d41dec43bdad9da7b28f64b36e
#: dcfbd1464e9242a0ab12d8101d318d80
msgid ""
"(Optionally) :ref:`CAN_D1_UC_SRV_RT<CAN_D1_UC_SRV_RT>`: rate that servo "
"outputs are sent from the autopilot to the actuator"
msgstr "（可选） :ref:`CAN_D1_UC_SRV_RT<CAN_D1_UC_SRV_RT>`：飞控向执行器发送舵机输出的速率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:26
#: 10856e7fb661484a9c96a931c7a6a127 1302891619b24323a69227a19053405d
#: 1ebfcfdf45b7484e933e2650f29faa5e 41ff1c0b267a4316bf634b9450c5af47
#: a1609e8f0d334e8aa7d75d54114f5fd8
msgid ""
"Himark servos use a different command set. In order to use them, also set "
":ref:`CAN_D1_UC_OPTION<CAN_D1_UC_OPTION>` bit 5 (+32)."
msgstr ""
"Himark舵机使用不同的命令集。为使用它们，还需将 :ref:`CAN_D1_UC_OPTION<CAN_D1_UC_OPTION>` "
"第5位（+32）置位。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:29
#: 332a46a5fa014dfe9748ba6d435dae0a 4c58b76eab4d40678dc71e331b5ba97e
#: 59761d07968c4e2e8a7a344e9c5b5007 abfd98b714de4293bc47db13f54a7bf3
msgid "AP_Periph Setup"
msgstr "AP_Periph 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:31
#: 09a9934fd3dd42a0b61abf8409ecc62a 26ed5d46db734e968efbe36a4465b305
#: 3f4b211223fe412aa190a5468c9fbe9c b98b40cba2b245db8317fd1f0b587390
msgid ""
"To set up servo control on an AP_Periph node, set the following parameters "
"on the node:"
msgstr "要在 AP_Periph 节点上设置舵机控制，请在该节点上设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:33
#: 30dc66fcc68448b49a57729d11e45e25 8c7dbb6500df4b7e940d28cabbf1a89d
#: b111c318016c4b6284143a316df10c5a c99405f89eda408b89d23a6149bff16a
msgid ""
":ref:`OUTx_FUNCTION<dev:OUT1_FUNCTION>` = 51 for actuator id 1, 52 for "
"actuator id 2, etc. This assigns the output channel to respond to "
"``uavcan.equipment.actuator.Command``."
msgstr ""
":ref:`OUTx_FUNCTION<dev:OUT1_FUNCTION>` = 51 对应执行器 id 1，52 对应执行器 id "
"2，依此类推。这会将该输出通道指定为响应 ``uavcan.equipment.actuator.Command``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:34
#: 09f4d7d87f5845df9b6c6bf25ed73c17 5864b7619a2c418a8825891a2b80fcdc
#: 7b45981e4b70445f83ba45f1c5bbd595 80c225d7fbe84a8987521d7095fc578d
msgid ""
":ref:`OUTx_MIN<dev:OUT1_MIN>` = 1100, the minimum PWM output in "
"microseconds. Set according to servo specifications."
msgstr ":ref:`OUTx_MIN<dev:OUT1_MIN>` = 1100，最小 PWM 输出（单位：微秒）。按舵机规格设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:35
#: 3f6d80694a45487ea0395b3561f38376 8fedb21a0a5345b298535aa4f89ec01b
#: 957f9a987aa6473f8c42421cf9df5f3d f4e137e1f7d243a08c71921d1748a227
msgid ""
":ref:`OUTx_MAX<dev:OUT1_MAX>` = 1900, the maximum PWM output in "
"microseconds. Set according to servo specifications."
msgstr ":ref:`OUTx_MAX<dev:OUT1_MAX>` = 1900，最大 PWM 输出（单位：微秒）。按舵机规格设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:36
#: 682b2e0b379546548b1212109f964416 b050344d343b4b6dad261e158db8d03d
#: d63b1d34132945bd869b5e3107079eec e8ed35c4556f4d3caf9a91c10591dd77
msgid ""
":ref:`OUTx_TRIM<dev:OUT1_TRIM>` = 1500, the PWM output in microseconds at "
"neutral autopilot command."
msgstr ":ref:`OUTx_TRIM<dev:OUT1_TRIM>` = 1500，飞控指令处于中位时的 PWM 输出（单位：微秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:37
#: 32b06aca118649869bf78601cac23f63 62f62fd00a8a4f15af7d2e294dc7c8d9
#: 8100f9279a2e461bb63f5f715f4a8df6 d0994339de4b412c9d0d483b37bfebf0
msgid ""
":ref:`OUTx_REVERSED<dev:OUT1_REVERSED>` = 0 (default), set to 1 to reverse "
"the servo direction."
msgstr ":ref:`OUTx_REVERSED<dev:OUT1_REVERSED>` = 0（默认），设为 1 可反转舵机方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:38
#: 00fc12134ea140c58de2fb8c6b9ce133 a77519b6e0df4b6393c1e67e2574d2fa
#: bacb597c4c604346afc5ea36598ecda6 d4b9b411e3ca4dcdac61857e46e92f74
msgid ""
":ref:`OUT_RATE<dev:OUT_RATE>` = 50 (default), output rate in Hz for all "
"servo outputs on the node."
msgstr ":ref:`OUT_RATE<dev:OUT_RATE>` = 50（默认），该节点上所有舵机输出的输出速率（单位：Hz）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:41
#: 14a6e50abfae4bff8bf5979c54464fae 5b5a82b7f8174205a5ec2223b5c494a2
#: d6ebaad740b544f2ba099bce5668726d f01a6a847e5048d5bf4a1c9ba565ef0e
msgid "Actuator Telemetry Setup"
msgstr "执行器数传设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:43
#: 9f41485a8f0646508e9daafe50f8e507 a62564ab7696400386dcd3f90761b9d2
#: bedaf161157846b995a04ddadefbbb92 d73d045b198d41b6bda9daf374cf07be
msgid ""
"Some AP_Periph nodes, such as the `Vimdrones L431 CAN Servo Hub "
"<https://dev.vimdrones.com/products/vimdrones_can_servo_hub/>`__, support "
"actuator telemetry via the ``uavcan.equipment.actuator.Status`` message, "
"which allows monitoring of servo current draw and load as a percentage of "
"rated current. Set the following parameters on the node:"
msgstr ""
"一些 AP_Periph 节点，如 `Vimdrones L431 CAN Servo Hub "
"<https://dev.vimdrones.com/products/vimdrones_can_servo_hub/>`__，支持通过 "
"``uavcan.equipment.actuator.Status`` "
"消息发送执行器数传，可以监测舵机电流消耗以及以额定电流百分比表示的负载。请在该节点上设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:45
#: 24294e070b934dd3ab83b4ee4d4868e8 6b35b472d7e441778c7ace685421cb0f
#: ac4a1ccd6af84927a2762b3ac0f7e221 deba588b4261409e9feca9794af7217e
msgid ""
":ref:`ACT_NUM_CHANS<dev:ACT_NUM_CHANS>` = 4, number of servo channels to "
"monitor for telemetry."
msgstr ":ref:`ACT_NUM_CHANS<dev:ACT_NUM_CHANS>` = 4，需要监测数传的舵机通道数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:46
#: 123eeef1370344da8f8fe53b26bbf48d 3a8e9fa128944e659a7d58959a66bd03
#: 413316e2586347f5842da65274becc6a 42b6e696f4984cc88addd7de7edda5c4
msgid ""
":ref:`ACT_CURR_PIN1<dev:ACT_CURR_PIN1>` = 9, starting ADC pin for current "
"monitoring on the Vimdrones L431 CAN Servo Hub used in this example. "
"Subsequent channels use the next pins (10, 11, ...) on that node; other "
"AP_Periph hardware may use different ADC pin numbering, so consult the "
"specific AP_Periph board documentation to determine the correct ADC pin IDs."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ACT_CURR_PIN1<dev:ACT_CURR_PIN1>` = 9，本例所用 Vimdrones L431 CAN Servo "
"Hub 上用于电流监测的起始 ADC 引脚。后续通道使用该节点上的后续引脚（10、11、...）；其他 AP_Periph 硬件的 ADC "
"引脚编号可能不同，请查阅具体 AP_Periph 板的文档以确定正确的 ADC 引脚 ID。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:47
#: 3def593f2a294ad69782a8b1c87bd6ff 42fddb2ddcab43fd98a146b927133b0d
#: 8b62cef9ba8b4a88afc3dcb4f5e925db c9dc69e9849449a5b23d3987719908b2
msgid ""
":ref:`ACT_AMP_OFFSET<dev:ACT_AMP_OFFSET>` = 0, current sensor offset in mA. "
"Used to zero-calibrate the sensor under no load."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ACT_AMP_OFFSET<dev:ACT_AMP_OFFSET>` = "
"0，电流传感器偏移量（单位：mA）。用于在空载时对传感器进行零点校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:48
#: 510e5654d25f4bc88a172a894b714036 a84fc5a1b22f4e0b8fdda68401f0d41f
#: ca552debe7cd4c9e90b0e0e0236c727e d19a4416bd5649f2b86ee92f5d02126f
msgid ""
":ref:`ACT_AMP_PERVLT<dev:ACT_AMP_PERVLT>` = 100, current sensor scale in mA "
"per volt."
msgstr ":ref:`ACT_AMP_PERVLT<dev:ACT_AMP_PERVLT>` = 100，电流传感器比例（单位：mA/V）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:49
#: 0bea50c313a1449f86c97ccd2642adfa 74906ca096e147a9b1158c62a879b79a
#: 7f0bc1e45bb143a6ac498d2e576e3555 f48237830f8e44a7936bb78d5ad88813
msgid ""
":ref:`ACT_CURR_MAX<dev:ACT_CURR_MAX>` = 2.5, maximum current in Amps, used "
"to calculate ``power_rating_pct`` in the telemetry message."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ACT_CURR_MAX<dev:ACT_CURR_MAX>` = 2.5，最大电流（单位：安培），用于计算数传消息中的 "
"``power_rating_pct``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dronecan-servos.rst:50
#: 680e19e8ad1c4bdb913de1c146578bcd 7e6118eaaf8942ccae5afc248cb2199e
#: bebf6de198414abe9b4817f7809e9e87 e19ce728d7d948b3827bf39a6074f5f5
msgid ""
":ref:`SRV_TLM_MSG_RATE<dev:SRV_TLM_MSG_RATE>` = 10, rate in Hz at which "
"telemetry messages are sent."
msgstr ":ref:`SRV_TLM_MSG_RATE<dev:SRV_TLM_MSG_RATE>` = 10，数传消息的发送速率（单位：Hz）。"
